1. `cd /gin && git diff --stat` and `sed -n '80,100p' errors.go` to see the current state (another agent may have touched the file; if `Unwrap` already has a value receiver `func (msg Error) Unwrap() error`, do not change it again).
2. Edit /gin/errors.go: change `func (msg *Error) Unwrap() error {` to `func (msg Error) Unwrap() error {`. Change NOTHING else. Do NOT edit any *_test.go file.
3. Verify with a temporary test file placed OUTSIDE the repo tree if possible; otherwise create /gin/zz_tmp_unwrap_check_test.go, run it, then DELETE it (the repo must end clean of it). The temp test must be in package `gin` and contain:
